  "description": "The Classic Plus - Gotham Edition has many of the award-winning features of our Plus model with an all-black design and modifications inspired by the New York streets we call home.\n\nThe Classic Plus - Gotham Edition is as comfortable in the city as it is standing out at your local coffee shop. Designed to be free from routine drivetrain maintenance, this bicycle has been featured in the industry-leading Gear Patrol commuter bicycle guide as being stylish enough for weekend rides, with features that are ready for the city grind. This bicycle weighs as much as a few bags of groceries (26lbs). Even better, the kickstand, water bottle cage, puncture resistant tires, and reflectors are all included.\n\nAll orders on in-stock items received by 12:00 PM EST will be shipped that business day. Click here for delivery times & more information.\nPSA: Most bicycles are selling out before they are produced. If you are looking to purchase a bicycle, we encourage you to back-order early. Our individual product pages reflect the most accurate back-order and ship dates for each model. These dates are updated in real-time for future purchases, and we generally sell out of most models before the date posted. Secure your ship date with a back-order, which can be cancelled at any time for a full refund before your bicycle ships.",
